needed to distribute audiovisual content"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Servers placed in China must be registered; ISPs must hold a value-added telecom license"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Requiring sellers to join the platform means the platform must verify identities, register data, report information, and retain records for three years"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"You must regulate user-generated content: moderation mechanisms, reporting portals, and immediate takedown plus reporting of illegal material"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/26-07","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Providing information publishing and instant messaging services requires users to provide authentic identity information"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"No live streaming accounts may be created for anyone under 16; tipping limits are set by age group"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Respond promptly to infringement notices; restore content after 15 days if no response"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Personal information must not be casually transferred overseas; legal conditions and thresholds apply"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/26-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"When picking a server, first consider how much downtime you can tolerate, then check whether there’s any support available, and only then compare prices"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/26"},"children":["Chapter 26"," ·"," ","Building a website or platform: licensing, registration, and servers"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"26-07"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["07"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Providing information publishing and instant messaging services requires users to provide authentic identity information"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["If your website allows posting or chatting, you must collect users’ real identity details at sign-up. Those who refuse to provide such information cannot be allowed to use the service. The recommended approach is to store the real name in the backend and let users pick their own nickname; phone number verification is sufficient for this purpose. Failure to enforce real-name policies results in mandatory corrective orders. Persistent violations attract fines ranging from 50,000 to 500,000 yuan, and may even lead to site shutdowns."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Implementing a real-name verification system involves payi…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The law explicitly states: “Internet service providers offering network access, domain registration, telephone…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Providing information publishing and instant messaging services requires users to provide authentic identity information"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Implementing a real-name verification system involves paying per-use fees for the verification channel. The service should be designed under the principle of “real names stored in the backend, nicknames displayed to users” — meaning the actual name is kept on file while users can choose any nickname they prefer on the interface."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The law explicitly states: “Internet service providers offering network access, domain registration, telephone services, or information publishing and instant messaging must demand authentic identity data from users at the time of agreement signing or service activation. Users who fail to supply such data cannot be granted service access.” Non-compliance — whether by neglecting to request real names or by knowingly allowing unverified users to join — triggers corrective orders. Serious or repeated breaches incur fines of 50,000–500,000 yuan, suspension of operations, mandatory business rectification, closure of websites or apps, and revocation of business licenses. Individual responsible parties face additional penalties of 10,000–100,000 yuan. Live streaming platforms must follow the same “backend real names, frontend nicknames” model, using mobile phone numbers for verification. For live commerce specifically, stricter rules apply: verification must rely on official identification documents and the unified social credit code — the unique identifier printed on every business license nationwide."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2025). 网络安全法（2025 年修正，2026 年 1 月 1 日施行，第二十六、六十四条；2016 年文本为第二十四、六十一条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-12/29/c_1768735112911946.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-12/29/c_1768735112911946.htm"]}," ; 国家互联网信息办公室 (2016). 互联网直播服务管理规定（第十二、十六条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2016-11/04/c_1119847629.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer